      room_events: { name: "Room events", kind: "room_events",
                     entries: texts("A shelf of greenware, every pot turned to face the door. They were turned recently.",
                                    "The floor is warm. Nothing has been lit here in forty years.",
                                    "A row of misfires, shelved and tagged. One tag has your maker's mark on it.",
                                    "Someone has chalked a loading list on the wall. Your names are near the bottom.",
                                    "A draft, from a flue that should be bricked up. It smells of bread.",
                                    "A slip hound, too scared to fight, offers to trade a secret for its life. It can't talk. It tries.",
                                    "A lamp still burns here. The oil is fresh.",
                                    "Wet footprints lead in and don't lead out.",
                                    "A saggar sits open and empty. The dust inside it is disturbed, in the shape of a hand.",
                                    "The walls are covered in tally marks, in slip. Hundreds. Some are fresh.",
                                    "A bone china doll's eyes follow whoever holds a light.",
                                    "Water drips upward from a puddle into the ceiling, and sets there as glaze.",
                                    "A fired man in old Guild robes, cracked across the chest, clutches a note: \"The cones lied.\"",
