                                    "A sleeping firebrick golem blocks half the room. It doesn't wake. Yet.",
                                    "The room is cold, and smells of the river.",
                                    "Carved over the door: a maker's mark one of you almost knows.",
                                    "A glaze vat shows the room with one more person in it.",
                                    "Grog on the floor glows faintly where you step.",
                                    "An old campsite. The bedrolls are still warm, and there's a bent cone on each one.") },
